nes/7/labels","id":173770,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMTczNzcw","number":7,"title":"GLM 0.9.9","description":"","creator":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":2,"closed_issues":212,"state":"open","created_at":"2012-09-12T10:39:38Z","updated_at":"2023-12-21T16:45:01Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2018-11-04T15:25:26Z","updated_at":"2018-11-05T19:07:13Z","closed_at":"2018-11-05T19:07:13Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi\r\n\r\nI've been using glm HEAD from homebrew and encountered a bug in one of the matrix conversion constructors due to the change to initializer lists starting from this version. Specifically, in commit dee806ea3f034afe803a1c00b8d027d542fe55a9, \r\nhttps://github.com/g-truc/glm/blob/dee806ea3f034afe803a1c00b8d027d542fe55a9/glm/detail/type_mat4x3.inl#L174-L186\r\n\r\nThe initializer list is incorrect and indeed is inconsistent with the old implementation.\r\n```cpp\r\n#\t\tif GLM_HAS_INITIALIZER_LISTS\r\n\t\t\t: value{col_type(m[0]), col_type(m[1]), col_type(m[2]), col_type(0)}\r\n#\t\tendif\r\n\t{\r\n#\t\tif !GLM_HAS_INITIALIZER_LISTS\r\n\t\t\tthis->value[0] = col_type(m[0]);\r\n\t\t\tthis->value[1] = col_type(m[1]);\r\n\t\t\tthis->value[2] = col_type(m[2]);\r\n\t\t\tthis->value[3] = col_type(m[3]);\r\n# endif\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe new implementation would leave the last column as 0 whereas it should be filled with the corresponding column of the 4x4 matrix when converting to 4x3.\r\n\r\nThis results in a mat4x3 which would have the last row be empty no matter what the mat4 is.","closed_by":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/829/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/829/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}